title "Boss"
description "Four-voice AVMS conversion of Boss.ftm, preserving tracker pitch, volume, duty, and timing."

// Converted from FamiTracker; this score is the game's editable source.
// Durations are milliseconds on AVM's 4 ms grid, retaining the original
// 60 Hz tracker timing after quantization. Constant frequency slides
// preserve pitch bends and vibrato between named semitones.
tempo 200
meter 4/4
loop
automation 8ms

instrument pulse { wave pulse duty 50% volume 0 gate 100% }
instrument percussion { wave noise volume 0 gate 100% }

